{"id":"wb-5-373","name":"大鹏所城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大鹏所城","text":"大鹏所城是中华人民共和国广东省深圳市大鹏新区大鹏街道一个面对大亚湾的古老的城村。被列入中国历史文化名村和第五批全国重点文物保护单位，是深圳八大景点和爱国主义教育基地之一。原有居民大都移民香港、荷兰或英国。村民通用大鹏话。著名的历史文物是龙井，赖府，刘府，四个城门，等等。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E9%B9%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":93657059,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93657059","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7d77ac6e83238cc5bc55a01a.jpg","title":"大鹏所城南门东路.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E9%B9%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9F%8E%E5%8D%97%E9%97%A8%E4%B8%9C%E8%B7%AF.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e8/%E5%A4%A7%E9%B9%8F%E6%89%80%E5%9F%8E%E5%8D%97%E9%97%A8%E4%B8%9C%E8%B7%AF.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Iswzo","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​从南门东路拍摄的大鹏所城南门","width":320,"height":213}}